      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Musa ea Haruni aba madeeda Sugoocheanda Misri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gawa Musa ea Haruni heeda Farao ak gwayeesha, “Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA Israeli, ‘Siksiina fugeasu gaweay, gwasinnean ghweelmeeda aba jeeda dareapcheeda.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Farao ak gwayeesha, “NG'UTAMIIDA ng'eaha, jea dayiiy ghuutaanyi ea dasiksa fuga Israeli gaweay? Aniini NG'UTAMIIDA mwaanali, ak ea maydasiksa fuga Israeli gaweay.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha, “Siroonyeewi ASEETA fuga Ebraniya, asi geemuscheey eeweaya eawooji samwagu aba jeeda dareapcheeda, ak geesisi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANYA lukghumeeda aba gideaba adiidu ghabwareasa aba dawni ghana ng'uta.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda sugoocheanda Misri ak gwayeesha saawa, “Musa ea Haruni ghwasaan anda gajageandeawana buuneeda heeda gadiyeeda nyaawa? Ang'eada aweayeena ea sareendeang'wa!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Farao ak gwayeesha, “Ng'ula fugeaba ng'eang'i ghamneawa aasaang'a ak ghamneawa gajanung' gafuufa gadiyeeda nyaawa!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean aba damandida ghoadayda Farao diigheanda aba heeda fuga miineadayda fuga gadiyeeda ea fuga ahaaghwa saawa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Adagudoatawji buuneeda nyeega sisna mwatafwaari, anung'waada gaweay saawa gagakiisa geat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak mooneeda mwatafwaareeda sin anung' gwasin mooneeda deena giika nea adoasuunyi eara gilimwanang', aba gideaba fiisu gaba ghaleehu inyeesa goojuur nea gwayi, ‘Asikseasa eeweaya eatawa ASEETEANYA lukghumeeda.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eatawa fiisu gadiyeeda hang'waay muuchi jea gwasawan ea mwanyasa gheata jea gooleeysiit ng'asheega ng'uyeega.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwarita jarooda fuga miineadaysa fuga gadiyeeda ea fuga ahaaghwa buuneeda ak gwayeesha buuneeda, “Gwayi Farao, ‘Maygutagooneegwa nyeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aweayeena daba siisi weah gagakiisa geaw aba gideaba gadiyeedeang'wa mayghwasuunya eara gilimwanang'.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwadarda buuneeda aba ng'eanyiisean bea Misri, ak geawaam ramda mida hoorgeeda gwachi bea nyeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwanung' fugiga miineadaysa buuneedean ghwalamwach buuneeda gadiyeeda nea gwayeesha, “Oahiida gadiyeedeang'wa, gawuurji gideaba eawoojisu iimida nyeega.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak fuga ahaaghwa fuga Israeli ghayi iin fuga miineadaysa gadiyeeda bea Farao badayda nyaawa, hean geabwar nea geepearsa, “Ghwasaan anda miyoahiida gadiyeedeang'wa bea heeta ea ghamneawa, asinda mwatafwaari gideaba eawoojisu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gaweay fuga ahaaghwa fuga Israeli heeda Farao ak gooyeawda nea gwayeesha, “Ghwasaan anda gihindineasa aseasa soomjoagaagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Soomjoagaagu miyeataw nyeega, ak geebisa eeyeeshiineasa, ‘Asina mwatafwaari!’ Asi ng'ula, geabwar soomjoagaagu, nea ramaseanda gaba fugaagu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda ak gwayeesha, “Goobeayi ghaleehu, goobeayi ghaleehu, ghoah gidooyeeni, ‘Sikseasa eeweaya eatawa NG'UTAMIIDA lukghumeeda.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aweayeena ghamneawa, agadiyeena nea manda nyeega jea eegooneegwa, ak ghabwada nih mooneeda mwatafwaari gajea giika.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwadaah fuga ahaaghwa fuga Israeli gideaba nihang'oonyiidi Ng'asheega, nea geeyeesha, “mayghoashoanya mooneeda mwatafwaari eara suh ng'ay, aba gadiyeeda galeagasean.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea geebiikna heeda Farao geeroonyi Musa ea Haruni hean ghoamuughu saawa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak geeyeesha Musa ea Haruni, “Gagasa ghwadaheagwa NG'UTAMIIDA ak ghwalach girgweageeda, aba gideaba noanung' eemunyasiita aba madeeda Farao ea soomjoagaaschi, ak ghoayiinyi ng'uta geatingaaschi ghabwareasa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Musa gooyeawusa Ng'utamiida",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gabiikta Musa gicha heeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak gwayeesha, “Ea NG'UTAMIIDA ghwasaan anda gisisi ng'asheega munyas fiisu? Ghwasaan anda giijeaktanean? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eada deaghayi eaweewi heeda Farao ak geabalooli aba gheawungaagu ea nisima fiisu ng'asheega munyas, ak ea mii aruuni fugaagu earahay.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.5.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
